# A first parity script: create a character, look around, walk, and type a few
# things that have no randomness in them.
#
# Deliberately no combat, no shops and no spells — those roll dice, and until
# the harness seeds both generators identically they would report differences
# that are not differences. What is here is message wording, which is exactly
# where reading the C has gone wrong repeatedly.
#
# Lines beginning with # are comments. A blank line IS sent: pressing return at
# the MOTD prompt is a real thing a player does.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
look
north
look
south
inventory
equipment
score
who
commands
socials
time
weather
exits
# Things that should fail, because the failure wording matters just as much.
get nothing
kill nobody
look at nothing
frobnicate
quit
